method:
Post-master QA of the 168 SHIPPING files (assets/audio/guidance/), decoded
from AAC exactly as bundled — at their real playback level, no re-gain:
 - leading silence before the first sound (spec 120-200 ms) and trailing
   silence after the last (leads 600-800 ms, parts/close 300-500 ms);
 - true peak (<= -1.5 dBTP), integrated loudness, sample peak;
 - the perceptual pause bed of every clip (A-weighted quietest pause window)
   and of each voice (quietest 10 % of pause windows, band split) — the
   frozen method, compared with the founder-verified anchors, no threshold;
 - lead -> part steps: the lead's speech level against the parts it
   precedes, by 10 ms-frame p90 (robust for one-word clips) and by LUFS;
 - cross-voice: each voice's median part loudness.
Usage: python -I post_master_qa.py <repo>
